    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "school_main_chara_historyteacher_03",
      "hash64": "E27F4B8E75633B7A",
      "text": "Sigo investigando este asunto de la fábula.\\nEn cuanto averigüe algo, te lo haré saber.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "school_main_chara_historyteacher_04",
      "hash64": "E27F468E756332FB",
      "text": "Ojalá te pique la curiosidad lo suficiente como\\npara hallar el paradero de los tesoros funestos.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "school_main_chara_historyteacher_05",
      "hash64": "E27F458E75633148",
      "text": "¿Qué tal te llevas con los tesoros funestos?\\c\\nSi no sabes qué hacer con ellos, tranquil[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa, ¿eh?\\n¡Que yo los adopto encantada![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "school_main_chara_healthteacher_01",
      "hash64": "AD66439216327F3E",
      "text": "Echa una cabezadita en la enfermería si estás\\ncansad[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa, ¿vale?[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "school_main_chara_healthteacher_02",
      "hash64": "AD66429216327D8B",
      "text": "Hola, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\nNo olvides que descansar también es importante.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "school_main_chara_hometeacher_01",
      "hash64": "1E92750EDE0E0DFB",
      "text": "Adelante, como si estuvieras en tu casa.\\nNo repares en mi presencia.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "school_main_chara_hometeacher_02",
      "hash64": "1E92760EDE0E0FAE",
      "text": "Si sabes de algún sitio donde vendan buenos\\ndulces, no dudes en compartir la información.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "school_main_chara_pokelogicalteacher_01",
      "hash64": "0608EFBD7D0DCC30",
      "text": "¡Buenas! ¿Has atrapado ya muchos Pokémon?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "school_main_chara_pokelogicalteacher_02",
      "hash64": "0608F2BD7D0DD149",
      "text": "Venga, intenta registrar al menos 30 especies\\nde Pokémon diferentes en la Pokédex, ¿vale?\\c\\nY cuando lo hayas hecho, ven a decírmelo.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
